---
title: "syncLegionAddresses (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: validate caller is authorized
    q_check_caller --> q_read_registry: read current addresses from addressRegistry
    q_read_registry --> q_update_legion: legionAddress = registry.getLegionAddress()
    q_update_legion --> q_update_signer: legionSigner = registry.getSignerAddress()
    q_update_signer --> [*]: emit AddressesSynced event

    q_check_caller --> q_revert: unauthorized
    q_revert --> [*]: revert Unauthorized

    note right of q_read_registry
        INV-001: address updates sourced from trusted registry contract
        INV-002: fee recipient and signer addresses stay current with registry
    end note
